text:
Redesign and remake this site with a header up,  a few explanations about it: "Weird Stuff is a sort of show made by Clip iMac Productions, this one has a series of eliminations and rejoins, followed with the Springi club consisting of Springis, which will pick members." and also a cool modern CSS
<html>
<head>
<title>Weird Stuff</title>
<style>
body {
background-color: #F0EFEF;
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

h1 {
text-align: center;
color: #6BDBDB;
margin-top: 50px;
}

#banner {
background-color: #F4A460;
color: white;
padding: 20px;
text-align: center;
font-size: 24px;
margin-top: 30px;
}

#banner a {
color: white;
text-decoration: none;
font-weight: bold;
}

#banner a:hover {
color: #F4A460;
background-color: white;
transition: all 0.3s ease;
border-radius: 5px;
padding: 5px;
box-shadow: 0 0 5px #D2B48C;
}

#springi {
background-color: #DCDCDC;
padding: 20px;
margin-top: 30px;
border-radius: 10px;
box-shadow: 0 0 10px #D2B48C;
}

#springi h2 {
color: #6BDBDB;
text-align: center;
margin-top: 0;
}

#springi ul {
list-style: none;
padding: 0;
margin: 0;
display: flex;
flex-wrap: wrap;
justify-content: space-around;
}

#springi li {
background-color: white;
color: #666;
border-radius: 5px;
padding: 10px;
margin: 10px;
box-shadow: 0 0 5px #D2B48C;
flex-basis: 25%;
text-align: center;
}

#springi img {
max-width: 100%;
max-height: 150px;
border-radius: 5px;
margin-bottom: 10px;
}

#test {
text-align: center;
margin-top: 50px;
color: #6BDBDB;
}

#test a {
color: #F4A460;
text-decoration: none;
font-weight: bold;
}

#test a:hover {
color: white;
background-color: #F4A460;
transition: all 0.3s ease;
border-radius: 5px;
padding: 5px;
box-shadow: 0 0 5px #D2B48C;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Weird Stuff</h1>
<div id="banner">
Weird Stuff has a club named Springi Club, it is compiled up of Springis. Check it out <a href="#">here</a>!
</div>
<div id="springi">
<h2>Springis Gallery</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<img src="springi1.jpg" alt="Springi 1">
<p>Springi 1</p>
</li>
<li>
