<p>Springi 7</p>
</li>
<li>
<img src="springi8.jpg" alt="Springi 8">
<p>Springi 8</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="test">
<p>Also, here's a test of the day:</p>
<a href="testofthedaysite.html">Mercredi.com</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
